  "label": "BSC V3 enter from stable",
  "category": "data",
  "description": "Mint a PancakeSwap V3 position funded from a stablecoin (e.g. USDT): resolve asymmetric or ±% range, size amount0/amount1 via v3LpAmountsFromStable, exactOutputSingle swap(s) of stable→non-stable legs, approve, mint. Saves v3PositionTokenId and range/policy vars for bindAlwaysOnBoundRow.",
  "defaultAction": {
    "type": "bscV3EnterFromStable",
    "runIf": "",
